# Shell scripts run inside Linux images: a checkout with core.autocrlf=true (Windows) must not
# give them CRLF. The backup image's entrypoint failed with `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r'` when built
# from such a checkout (2026-10-27, release 34ad0c4).
*.sh text eol=lf
# Dockerfiles are read inside Linux build contexts too: a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true) leaves
# a `\r` on every RUN line and breaks the guards that read them (pkgBasePin.a325, 2026-11-04).
Dockerfile text eol=lf
